Current test macros:
{SLEEP N} - Delay execution by N milliseconds.
{ENTER} - Send ENTER key press.
{SENDKEY X} - Send character X, a key name (ENTER, TAB, F1-F12) or a VK code to the target window.
{INPUT[TYPE:DEFAULT_VALUE] NAME} - Show a text input dialog and replace macro with input. Examples:
  {INPUT Name}
  {INPUT[STRING:test string] Name}
  {INPUT[NUMBER:100] Size}
  {INPUT[FLOAT:3.14] Size}
  {INPUT[Hex:FF] Color}
  {INPUT[Password] Password}
  {INPUT[DATE:2026-01-31] Date}
  {INPUT[Confirm] Text for user} - Pause execution and wait for user confirmation.

